<Base title="Contact | Passport Office Finder" desc="Report outdated facility information or corrections.">
<main class="wrap">
  <h1 style="font-size:1.7rem">Contact</h1>
  <p class="lead">Spotted an outdated phone number or a facility that moved?</p>
  <p>Email <strong>info@passportofficefinder.com</strong> with the facility name and the correction. We verify every report against official sources before publishing.</p>
  <div class="note"><strong>Please note:</strong> we are not a government office and cannot book appointments, check application status, or access any passport records. For status, use the State Department's online tool; for appointments, contact the facility directly.</div>
</main>
</Base>
